Subject: [PATCH] feat(status): GET /status/assistant says answering, not
 answering or unknown (D699)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The frontend's new design draws the „online" dot green only while the
assistant really answers, „Netai არ პასუხობს …-დან" while it does not, and
nothing while nobody knows. The heartbeat already holds the facts; no route
exposed them.

The state comes from two rows: the newest successful Anthropic call in
usage_events (a real reply or the heartbeat probe), and an open
provider_refusing incident. A refusal with nothing answered after it is
not_answering, since its start. An answer within 45 minutes is answering;
25 min of silence before a probe, plus a 10 min check, is the stalest a
healthy server gets. Anything else is unknown, so a stopped heartbeat can
never keep the dot green.

Contract in docs/FOR_FRONTEND.md.

